<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Proposal 3</b>: To approve the adjournment
of the meeting, if necessary or advisable, to solicit additional proxies in favor of the Reverse Stock Split Proposal (the &#8220;Adjournment
Proposal&#8221;).</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

